{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.FullRankFromWedderburn","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.FullRankFromWedderburn","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.FullRank","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3Wedderburn","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4Wedderburn","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Dimension.Constructions"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.wedderburn₄_block_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.wedderburn₄_block_count","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L116-L118","doc":"`H₄(q)`'s Wedderburn blocks sum to its dimension: `1 + 1 + 2² + 3² + 3² = 4!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.wedderburn₃_block_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.wedderburn₃_block_count","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L113-L114","doc":"`H₃(q)`'s Wedderburn blocks sum to its dimension: `1 + 1 + 2² = 3!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.isHeckeOfFullRank_H4A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.isHeckeOfFullRank_H4A","kind":"instance","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L101-L105","doc":"**`H₄(q)` has the full Iwahori rank `24 = 4!`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.finrank_H4A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.finrank_H4A","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L93-L99","doc":"**`dim_K H₄(q) = 24 = 4!`.** This is the half the retired `QOU.Hecke.InstanceH4`\nnever had: it carried a `HeckeAlgebra R 4 q` instance on an operator algebra whose\ndimension was never pinned (bean qou-ti7p). Here the relations and the rank hold of\none and the same carrier. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h4CoordEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h4CoordEquiv","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L84-L91","doc":"`H4A R h` is its coordinate space, on the subscript 24-word basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.isHeckeOfFullRank_H3A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.isHeckeOfFullRank_H3A","kind":"instance","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L76-L80","doc":"**`H₃(q)` has the full Iwahori rank.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.finrank_H3A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.finrank_H3A","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L71-L74","doc":"**`dim_K H₃(q) = 6 = 3!`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.h3CoordEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.h3CoordEquiv","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/FullRankFromWedderburn.lean#L61-L69","doc":"`H3A R h` is its coordinate space: the structure has the single field\n`v : Fin 6 → R`, and its module structure is componentwise on it. ","signatureChunk":0}]}